OL,3,GNEWSAVandals strike historic church
OL,4,Asite
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners fighting to save a Grade II
OL,7,Flisted 15th Century church tower say
OL,8,Fthey are to step up security after the
OL,9,Fgraveyard was vandalised.
OL,11,FHertfordshire Police said holes were
OL,12,Fdug in the ground of Thundridge Old
OL,13,FChurch of St Mary and All Saints, near
OL,14,FWare, on 16 August.
OL,16,FOfficers have released CCTV footage
OL,17,Fshowing a group of men in the area with
OL,18,Fwhat appeared to be metal detectors
OL,19,Fbehind them.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
