OL,3,GNEWSAVandals strike historic church
OL,4,Asite
OL,5,
OL,6,FDave Blowers, chairman of Thundridge
OL,7,FOld Church Action Group (TOCAG), said:
OL,8,F"Every act of vandalism takes time and
OL,9,Fmoney to deal with and collectively
OL,10,Fmakes our vision less likely to
OL,11,Fsucceed."
